## output
output

summary/*.pdf
# The RENDERED dashboard only. Source files under summary/ must not end in .html --
# this rule swallowed the pandoc template until it was renamed to embed.tpl, and the
# same trap applies to summary/*.txt, which is why committed tables there are .tsv.
summary/*.html
# knitr's intermediate, written beside the document every render.
summary/*.knit.md
# knitr's per-document figure directory and Rscript's stray default device, both build leavings.
summary/*_files/
Rplots.pdf
summary/*.txt
/processing/raw_data/

## vdjdb build (rewrite)
out/
.venv/
uv.lock.tmp
## The release the comparison measures against. `build.yml` downloads it to this exact path before
## running `vdjdb diff`, and the same name is the convention locally, so it is a fetched input sitting
## in the working tree of every checkout that has ever compared a build. 72 MB, and it is a published
## artifact - it is re-downloaded, never restored from here (hard rule 9: fetching an input is not a
## cache, and committing one would make it look like a cache).
/reference.zip

## Proprietary held-out validation data -- TCRvdb / MATCHMAKERS is academic, non-commercial and
## NON-REDISTRIBUTABLE. It must never be committed here. Read it via $VDJDB_TCRVDB instead.
## Enforced by src/vdjdb/validate/guard.py and tests/unit/test_guard.py.
*TCRvdb*
*tcrvdb*
*MATCHMAKERS*
*matchmakers*

